Z||000007||Cliff Pennock||10-03-2000||08:50 PM||||That's what I said, it reflects the <B>current</B> number of messages. And I should've added: at the time the last message in that thread was posted.<P>When you view a thread, you are actually looking at a page that was generated at the time the last message in that thread was posted. It's never updated after that.<P>So, yes, if you are viewing an old thread you could see the wrong number of posts. But, no, the actual counter never misses a message...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
